-/-- The transpose of the `n × n` matrix `Y` (entry `(k, j)` at `k n + j`) with `c` added: cell
-`q = j n + k` holds `Y[k n + j] + c`. -/
-def transposeL (n : ℕ) (c : ℤ) (Y : List ℤ) : List ℤ :=
-  (List.range (n * n)).map fun q => Y.getD (q % n * n + q / n) 0 + c
