-The statements and proofs are adapted from upstream
-`ThreeSumApsp/Programs/Sec4/Theorem30/Time.lean` and `TimeOfBlock.lean` (Apache-2.0) and from
-`ImprovedExponents/Cost8X/Within.lean`.
