-  `3v ≤ u + 2((1 - u)/2 - q) = 1 - 2q`, so `2v ≤ μ := min(a, γ_Q(θ)) ≤ Γ`, and
-  `ε v < R(a) v ≤ R(μ) μ/2 = F(μ) ≤ F(Γ)`;
