-/-- `Claim17Mid` is `HostBound` with the solver charged at `⌈⌊√D⌋/g⌉ ⌊√D⌋`. -/
-theorem hostBound_iff_claim17Mid (M : DetTimeModel) (MM : ℕ → ℝ) (D g : ℕ → ℕ) :
-    HostBound M MM D g (fun n => pieceSizeNat (D n) (g n) * Nat.sqrt (D n))
