+/-- A query to the data structure of Theorem 30 changes only cells of its block, so that the
+structure stays ready. -/
+-- adapted from upstream ThreeSumApsp/Programs/Sec4/ChoosingParameters/Parameters.lean
+-- (Ready31.of_query)
