-  light_call (C.powTable h10 3 (p.aP3 b0) μ) with rP3 μP3 ⟨sP3, fP3⟩
-  light_call (C.powTable h10 4 (p.aP4 b0) μP3) with rP4 μP4 ⟨sP4, fP4⟩
-  light_call (C.powTable h10 7 (p.aP7 b0) μP4) with rP7 μP7 ⟨sP7, fP7⟩
