+/-- Cell `i Λ + β` of the table holds digit `β` of the label of the `i`-th number. -/
+theorem getD_bitTable (V Λ : ℕ) (L : List ℤ) {i β : ℕ} (hi : i < L.length) (hβ : β < Λ) :
