-/-!
-# APSP from the (min,+)-product: the claim
-
-The running time of the host (`apTime`, `isHost_ap`) in the form of the claim
-`ApspFromMinPlus`: `⌈log₂ n⌉ + 1` times the sum of the time of a (min,+)-product of
