-walk `c` with at least one edge, and a walk `q`. -/
-private theorem exists_closed_piece {n : ℕ} (i : Fin n) (rest : List (Fin n))
-    (h : n ≤ rest.length) :
-    ∃ p c q : List (Fin n),
