-  `IsPowLittleO.const_mul`);
-* `(n^{d+o(1)})^{c+o(1)} = n^{cd+o(1)}` for `c, d ≥ 0` (`IsPowLittleO.comp`);
-* `O(n^a)` and `O(n^a (log n)^{O(1)})` are `n^{a+o(1)}` (`IsBigOPow.isPowLittleO`,
-  `IsPowPolylog.isPowLittleO`).
